@davidbielik Card details should be collected client-side with [Elements](https://stripe.com/docs/stripe-js#elements) or [Checkout](https://stripe.com/docs/payments/checkout) for security and [PCI compliance](https://stripe.com/docs/security/guide#validating-pci-compliance) reasons. There's almost never a valid use-case to pass those server-side in stripe-node, especially to the `Token` creation endpoint.
